@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Play the hop after a duel is won
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Child" as actor
box "Frontend — game" #E0F2FE
  participant "SoloGame" as session
  participant "MomentSounds" as moments
  participant "DuelPage" as duel
  participant "WorldMapPage" as map
end box
box "Frontend — domain" #E0F2FE
  participant "BrowserSound" as sound
end box
box "Frontend — world" #E0F2FE
  participant "ThreeClassroomRenderer" as renderer
end box
actor -> session : Correct answer; the duel is decided, speech recognition has stopped
session --> moments : Moment answerCorrect
moments -> sound : play(chime)
alt sound is on and the child has touched the page
  sound --> actor : Chime (L2-039 criterion 1)
else muted, or no touch yet
  sound -> sound : Play nothing (L2-039 criteria 2 and 3)
end
session --> duel : Duel won
duel -> renderer : show(state): the kid plays winCheer
duel --> actor : "= {answer} You got it!" for 1 second, then the passport stamp lands in place of the flash card for 1.2 seconds (L2-033 criterion 7, L2-038 criterion 5)
session --> map : World Map opens on the hop
session --> moments : Moment countryReached
moments -> sound : play(jingle)
map --> actor : "You walk on to {country}!" for 1.6 seconds (L2-034 criteria 3 and 9)
map -> renderer : show(state): the kid hops from the desk of the duel
alt full motion
  renderer --> actor : Kid walks along the path to the next desk in 1.4 seconds (L2-038 criterion 1)
else the device asks for reduced motion
  renderer --> actor : Kid fades out and in at the next desk, 200 ms in all; nothing moves across the screen (L2-038 criterion 4)
end
session --> duel : Duel returns; the new flash card flips in within 300 ms, or fades in (L2-038 criteria 2 and 4)
@enduml
